em\u003eChương 5. Tạo ra nội dung để chia sẻ trên Facebook\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eChương 6. Liên minh chiến lược\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eChương 7. Vươn ra toàn cầu\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eChương 8. Tạo ra ảnh hưởng trên Instagram \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eChương 9. Những yếu tố thúc đẩy tăng trưởng trên Youtube\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eChương 10. Những thực tế về Snapchat\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eChương 11. Tăng trưởng kinh tế đáng kể với Linkedin\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eChương 12. Củng cố vị thế\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"alignnone wp-image-3731 lazy-load-active lazy-loaded\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/38/e2/0b/52dcc828615f61c68b59b6dada3f0156.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 595px) 100vw, 595px\" srcset=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/38/e2/0b/52dcc828615f61c68b59b6dada3f0156.jpg 2048w, https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/81/ce/38/3526179b680003427a155b16712966ce.jpg 300w, https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/4c/cf/60/45d71687f85d2153055854c32e5b4b77.jpg 768w, https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/84/60/a0/26569d850f6a34ccc15dcde2dc581f90.jpg 1024w, https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/f3/65/6b/b3c8087c8bae9d37825afad1f9de92cd.jpg 196w, https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/00/ab/19/dd7d008b579365acb2bb7737cc488e6e.jpg 600w, https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/56/34/18/61d23efc9291fc1fe27db433c8882a26.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"595\" height=\"594\" data-src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/70012278_2698580403701907_3340354434428305408_o.jpg\" data-srcset=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/38/e2/0b/52dcc828615f61c68b59b6dada3f0156.jpg 2048w, https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/81/ce/38/3526179b680003427a155b16712966ce.jpg 300w, https://salt.tik